\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The two CTC operations used in this project. (a)~Collapsing the emitted path gives the transcription, so a line can be trained from its text alone with no character boundaries. (b)~Given the text, forced alignment finds the most probable block of time steps for each character; the dashed lines are the resulting territories, from which individual letter shapes are cut. Blank symbols are shaded.}}{3}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
